ld Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133239754,imgsize-1630200.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why has Britain's grass turned yellow? Scientists warn about the future of the island after 'driest month ever']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133238537.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[After experiencing the driest July on record, England's picturesque green fields have succumbed to a fading yellow hue. This alarming trend of increasing heatwaves significantly affects lawns and public parks. While native grasses possess resilience during droughts and can deepen their roots to conserve water, extended dry periods inevitably lead them to enter a dormant state, awaiting rain.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/why-has-britains-grass-turned-yellow-scientists-warn-about-the-future-of-the-island-after-driest-month-ever/articleshow/133238537.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/why-has-britains-grass-turned-yellow-scientists-warn-about-the-future-of-the-island-after-driest-month-ever/articleshow/133238537.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-14T16:18:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133238585,imgsize-229421.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nearly 80 men found shackled in an ancient Athens mass grave were locals]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133238216.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/nearly-80-men-found-shackled-in-an-ancient-athens-mass-grave-were-locals-not-outsiders/articleshow/133238216.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[ht